{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-03-10 13:23:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY AWARDS MORE THAN $300,000 IN GRANTS TO INNOVATIVE K-12 EDUCATION INITIATIVES ACROSS INDIANA', 'text': 'PLAINFIELD, IND. , MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE DUKE ENERGY FOUNDATION TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS AWARDING MORE THAN $300,000 IN GRANTS TO 24 INNOVATIVE K-12 EDUCATION PROGRAMS SERVING COMMUNITIES ACROSS INDIANA.'}{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2022-03-10 12:51:00', 'title': "DUKE ENERGY FLORIDA'S INNOVATIVE BATTERY STORAGE PROJECTS PROVIDE CUSTOMER, GRID BENEFITS", 'text': "ST. PETERSBURG, FLA. , MARCH 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DELIVERING ON THE COMPANY'S COMMITMENT TO EXPAND BATTERY ENERGY STORAGE TECHNOLOGY IN FLORIDA, DUKE ENERGY TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF THREE BATTERY PROJECTS IN GILCHRIST, GULF AND HIGHLANDS COUNTIES."}